{"seq":2,"slug":"one-to-many-split-match","title":"一对多/部分匹配/合并付款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-reconciliation-hub-global/auto-matching-engine/one-to-many-split-match","wordCount":2194,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"一对多-部分匹配-合并付款\">一对多/部分匹配/合并付款</h1><p>如果对账引擎只处理一对一，它的自动匹配率会在真实渠道面前迅速崩掉。原因是一个几乎所有渠道都会做、但工程师往往到上线后才知道的事实：<strong>渠道付给你的钱，和你的订单，绝大多数时候不是一一对应的。</strong> 本文讲这类匹配的形态、算法与工程约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四种基数关系\">核心概念：四种基数关系</h2><p>把匹配问题按基数分类，能立刻看清复杂度分布。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基数关系</th>\n<th>业务场景</th>\n<th>匹配难度</th>\n<th>典型渠道</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一对一</td>\n<td>单笔交易单独结算</td>\n<td>低（精确键）</td>\n<td>多数卡渠道逐笔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一对多</td>\n<td>一笔结算打款含多笔订单（合并付款）</td>\n<td>高（子集求和）</td>\n<td>所有按 payout 结算的渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多对一</td>\n<td>一笔订单因部分发货/部分退款拆成多次结算</td>\n<td>中（可分拆校验）</td>\n<td>分期履约、部分退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多对多</td>\n<td>双向拆合同时发生</td>\n<td>很高（通常拆成两次匹配）</td>\n<td>复杂 marketplace</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>合并付款（batch payout）是常态而不是例外。</strong> 渠道通常按日或按结算周期把所有可结算交易聚成一个批次，扣除手续费与退款后，打一笔净额给你，文件里给的是「批次头 + 批次内明细」。如果平台的账本记录粒度是订单、渠道文件的粒度是批次，那么「一笔对一笔」永远匹配不上；必须先把批次展开成明细，或者把平台的订单聚合到批次。</p>\n<p>两条路各有代价。<strong>展开明细</strong>要求渠道文件本身提供明细——多数渠道提供，但有的只给净额加一份单独的交易查询接口，需要额外拉取。<strong>聚合订单到批次</strong>不需要额外接口，但聚合结果的金额必须精确等于批次净额，而这要求平台能正确预测「渠道会把哪些订单放进这个批次」——一旦预测错误（例如渠道因风控暂扣了某笔），聚合就不平。实践中推荐前者：优先用渠道给的明细，聚合只作为备选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合并付款的匹配算法\">合并付款的匹配算法</h2><p>核心问题可以精确表述为：给定一个目标净额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 和一批候选交易金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，找出子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i \\in S} a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 之差落在容差内。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1..</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{S \\subseteq \\{1..n\\}}\\ \\Bigl|\\, T - \\sum_{i \\in S} a_i \\,\\Bigr| \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad |S| \\le k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.116em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是一个子集求和问题，判定版本是 NP 完全的。但真实场景有几个性质让它变得可解：候选集合的规模通常被批次约束（一个批次里的交易数一般不超过数千）、金额是最小单位整数（可以用动态规划）、并且<strong>通常有额外的业务键可以大幅缩小候选集</strong>（批次日期、币种、商户）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    B[渠道批次净额 T] --&gt; N[候选集收缩]&#10;    N --&gt; N1[按批次日期 ± 窗口]&#10;    N --&gt; N2[按币种]&#10;    N --&gt; N3[按商户/账户]&#10;    N1 --&gt; DP[带约束的子集求和]&#10;    N2 --&gt; DP&#10;    N3 --&gt; DP&#10;    DP --&gt; C{找到解?}&#10;    C --&gt;|唯一解| OK[高置信匹配]&#10;    C --&gt;|多解| AMB[取业务最优解&lt;br/&gt;标记待复核]&#10;    C --&gt;|无解| EX[进入差异处理]\">graph TD\n    B[渠道批次净额 T] --&gt; N[候选集收缩]\n    N --&gt; N1[按批次日期 ± 窗口]\n    N --&gt; N2[按币种]\n    N --&gt; N3[按商户/账户]\n    N1 --&gt; DP[带约束的子集求和]\n    N2 --&gt; DP\n    N3 --&gt; DP\n    DP --&gt; C{找到解?}\n    C --&gt;|唯一解| OK[高置信匹配]\n    C --&gt;|多解| AMB[取业务最优解&lt;br/&gt;标记待复核]\n    C --&gt;|无解| EX[进入差异处理]</pre><p><strong>算法选择建议：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>候选集收缩优先。</strong> 在写任何求解器之前，先把候选集从「当日全部交易」缩到「该批次日期该币种该商户的交易」。这一步通常能把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 从十万级降到百级，让后面的求解变得轻松。<strong>收缩依据必须来自渠道文件本身提供的字段</strong>，而不是猜测——猜测会引入错误归因。</p>\n<p><strong>整数背包动态规划处理中小规模。</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 在数百、金额范围可控时，用「金额为容量」的 DP 或带记忆化的哈希求解即可，复杂度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在最小单位整数上，实际可用。需要加一个解的上限计数（找到若干个解就停），因为我们通常不需要枚举所有解。</p>\n<p><strong>启发式处理大规模。</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 上千时，改用「按金额降序贪心 + 局部修正」：先贪心选大额，剩余差额用小额补充，失败时回退一步换一组。它不保证最优，但<strong>保证在有解时大概率找到</strong>，且时间可预测。对于找到的解，用绝对残差与业务约束（例如日期必须在批次窗口内）校验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多解-稳定性与幂等\">多解、稳定性与幂等</h2><p>合并匹配最容易出事的地方不是「找不到解」，而是「找到了不同的解」。</p>\n<p><strong>同一份输入必须产出同一个解。</strong> 否则今天匹配上的记录，明天重算时会匹配到另一组交易，导致对账结果漂移——这是第四章第 3 篇历史重算的死敌。保证确定性的方法是给解排一个全序：先比较解的残差绝对值，再比较解的记录数，再比较解中金额最小者的字典序。这套比较规则必须写进代码并被测试覆盖。</p>\n<p><strong>多解必须被标记而不是随便挑一个。</strong> 当存在多个残差相同的解时，说明仅凭金额无法区分。此时应当输出「多解待复核」，而不是静默选第一个。常见的多解情形是存在若干笔金额完全相同的交易——它们的任意交换组合都产生同一个和。补救手段是引入业务键：同一用户、同一订单的多笔交易更可能在一个批次里；同一时间窗口优先。<strong>引入启发式后仍无法唯一确定时，宁可建单让人确认，也不要赌。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>幂等靠匹配结果本身落库。</strong> 匹配动作应当是「计算 + 写入匹配关系」两步，写入时以「已匹配记录集合」为键做幂等：如果这组记录已经被同一个批次认领过，重复执行是空操作。这与<a href=\"../recon-platform-ops/recon-rule-version\">对账规则版本化与回归</a>中的重放语义一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分匹配与残差处理\">部分匹配与残差处理</h2><p>不是所有情况都能整批匹配上。真实场景里更常见的是「批次内的交易匹配上了 98 笔，剩 2 笔金额对不上」，这时不能整批判失败。</p>\n<p><strong>残差分解。</strong> 把批次净额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 分解成可识别部分与残差：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = \\sum_{i \\in S} a_i + R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。对残差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 逐项尝试归因——它是否恰好等于该批次的手续费？是否是某笔退款？是否是一笔尚未进入平台的交易？这个分解过程应该按「最可能的口径」排序，每一步都记录用掉的假设。这部分归因逻辑与<a href=\"../multi-channel-recon/three-way-match-global\">交易-渠道账单-银行流水三方勾对</a>的五类差异分类共用同一套判定规则。</p>\n<p><strong>部分匹配的账务表达。</strong> 部分匹配的状态是「部分已匹配」，它是一个合法的中间状态，不能被简化成「已匹配」或「未匹配」。资金视图需要知道「这个批次有 98 笔已确认、2 笔待查」，因为那 2 笔代表真实的资金敞口。因此匹配关系表必须支持「一个批次关联多个已匹配记录 + 若干未决残差项」。</p>\n<p><strong>合并付款的反向场景：一单拆多批。</strong> 一笔订单因为部分发货或部分退款，在渠道侧变成两笔结算。匹配时应当允许「一笔平台记录对应多个渠道批次」，但必须校验：这些批次的金额之和等于订单金额（减去已发生的退款），且每个批次的日期在订单生命周期内。这类匹配的置信度通常给 0.8 左右，因为它依赖对拆分原因的正确推断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>匹配方向</th>\n<th>校验条件</th>\n<th>建议置信度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合并付款</td>\n<td>一批对多笔平台记录</td>\n<td>子集和 = 批次净额 ± 容差</td>\n<td>0.85 到 0.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分发货拆分</td>\n<td>一单对多批</td>\n<td>批次金额和 = 订单金额 - 退款</td>\n<td>0.75 到 0.85</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分退款拆分</td>\n<td>一单对多批（含负项）</td>\n<td>同上，含负金额</td>\n<td>0.75 到 0.85</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多解情形</td>\n<td>任一方向</td>\n<td>无法唯一确定</td>\n<td>标记待复核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>渠道按批次打款是常态，一对一匹配在真实场景下必然不够用；必须先解决基数关系问题。</li>\n<li>合并付款匹配是带约束的子集求和问题，靠候选集收缩把复杂度降到可解，再用 DP 或启发式求解。</li>\n<li>匹配结果必须确定性、可重放：解的全序比较规则要写进代码并测试，否则重算会漂移。</li>\n<li>多解时标记待复核而不是静默选择；宁可建单让人确认，也不要赌。</li>\n<li>部分匹配是合法中间状态，残差要按口径逐项归因并与三方勾对的差异分类共享判定规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一对多/部分匹配/合并付款","id":"一对多-部分匹配-合并付款"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四种基数关系","id":"核心概念-四种基数关系"},{"level":2,"text":"合并付款的匹配算法","id":"合并付款的匹配算法"},{"level":2,"text":"多解、稳定性与幂等","id":"多解-稳定性与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"部分匹配与残差处理","id":"部分匹配与残差处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"匹配规则/容差/多级策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-reconciliation-hub-global/auto-matching-engine/match-rule-engine"},"next":{"title":"差异自动建单与处理流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-reconciliation-hub-global/auto-matching-engine/exception-workflow"}}